Subject: drivers: build the builtin SukiSU driver
Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [integration step; SukiSU's kernel/setup.sh makes the same edits]
Drop-when: never; this is how the driver enters the kernel build

Add drivers/kernelsu to drivers/Kconfig and drivers/Makefile, as
SukiSU's setup.sh does for a builtin build. bootstrap creates the
drivers/kernelsu symlink from configs/source-links.json.
---
diff --git a/drivers/Kconfig b/drivers/Kconfig
index 0d399ddaa185a7cdf5974f7f294f50032747f577..6ed612d9c97d760df6e4d70e6b509bcecff3d7e2 100644
--- a/drivers/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/Kconfig
@@ -236,4 +236,5 @@ source "drivers/interconnect/Kconfig"
 source "drivers/counter/Kconfig"
 
 source "drivers/most/Kconfig"
+source "drivers/kernelsu/Kconfig"
 endmenu
diff --git a/drivers/Makefile b/drivers/Makefile
index a110338c860c770d4affa688375dc2086007a6b5..f25c0c20e405d09ddadb823dff9a1218d08909d2 100644
--- a/drivers/Makefile
+++ b/drivers/Makefile
@@ -187,3 +187,5 @@ obj-$(CONFIG_GNSS)		+= gnss/
 obj-$(CONFIG_INTERCONNECT)	+= interconnect/
 obj-$(CONFIG_COUNTER)		+= counter/
 obj-$(CONFIG_MOST)		+= most/
+
+obj-$(CONFIG_KSU) += kernelsu/
